<a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/davenport-ia" target="_self">QC Power Equipment</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/valparaiso-in" target="_self"></a><a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/valparaiso-in" target="_self">Gruel Bros.</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/lebanon-in" target="_self">Howard's</a>, and <a href="https://russopower.com/a/store-locator/greenfield-in" target="_self">Superior Mowers</a> we’re honoring their history while equipping their teams with more tools to succeed. It's growth rooted in respect for the people, the place, and the profession.</p><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-122_"><a href="/blogs/russo-news/honoring-legacies" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-123_ pf-button-2">Read Their Stories</a></div></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-125_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo-Locations-Map-with-Acquisitions_SEPT2025_500x.jpg?v=1794257020" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo-Locations-Map-with-Acquisitions_SEPT2025.jpg?v=1794257020 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Russo-Locations-Map-with-Acquisitions_SEPT2025_500x.jpg?v=1794257020 320w" width="800" height="584" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo Locations Map updated Nov 2026" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-126_"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-127_">Midwest Roots</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-129_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our roots are here. We value what the Midwest stands for: honesty, hard work, and community. That culture lives in our People Power’d approach and it shows in how we serve.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-131_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-c415" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-133_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-134_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-135_">Where We've Been: A Legacy of Service</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-137_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">For over five decades, <strong>customer service has been at the core of Russo's success</strong>. In the Midwest, we're known for helping pros keep moving: fixing it, finding it, or staying late to make it happen. We built this business on hustle, relationships, and respect for the working professional.<br></p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-kRyGGt dasEGc pf-139_ animate-float pf-bg-lazy pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide">VISIT US!</a></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-141_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse_500x.jpg?v=1748571743" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse.jpg?v=1748571743 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/CHAR2117-Russo-Elgin-forklift-warehouse_500x.jpg?v=1748571743 320w" width="1200" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Russo Elgin forklift warehouse" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-142_"/></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-b5ef" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-cjzOqx cClVOL pf-143_"><div class="sc-fyDLC cfGIPw pf-flex-section"><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-144_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale_500x.jpg?v=1785335411" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale.jpg?v=1785335411 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale_500x.jpg?v=1785335411 320w" width="800" height="1066" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="Mooresville-Road-Sign-grayscale.jpg__PID:23ac8424-f8ea-4e6c-b55f-1786bb781b32" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-cGKGxe kTcJEg pf-145_"/></div><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-ktvVSB byWlOZ pf-146_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dvUzvb hTWHLO pf-147_">About the Logo</h3><p class="sc-cuzrMV juwaqG pf-149_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Outdoor Power Plus pairs with the Russo logo.&nbsp;“Outdoor Power” says what we do. “Plus” says there’s more to it. It doesn’t replace Russo; it adds to it.<br> </p></div></div></section></div></div></div><script>
